        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "they gathered themselves together to fight with Joshua and with Israel, with one accord.",
      "ko": "모여서 일심으로 여호수아와 이스라엘로 더불어 싸우려 하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f12d3643031ed672e60e06f168493d8c8ffab84ee27afc81be3ba6b2983696ae",
      "translation_text_hash": "94022330bdb2c9cac3a6064a9eefcaed12b5076608e96e89e8d8b35d2768db02",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "모여서 일심으로 여호수아와 이스라엘로 더불어 싸우려 하더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "94022330bdb2c9cac3a6064a9eefcaed12b5076608e96e89e8d8b35d2768db02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOS:9:3",
      "sequence": 6041,
      "chapter_label": "JOS 9",
      "verse_label": "3",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JOS",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 3
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "But when the inhabitants of Gibeon heard what Joshua had done to Jericho and to Ai,",
      "ko": "기브온 거민들이 여호수아의 여리고와 아이에 행한 일을 듣고",
      "source_text_hash": "49b443445bd258c8671ff38eae42a618ede17ae2a3a94a93232aaa978c50c9c6",
      "translation_text_hash": "c6362b6e48fe3aa0ccba0563abadbdace55349c2460e5f604cf99f520dcf4d43",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "기브온 거민들이 여호수아의 여리고와 아이에 행한 일을 듣고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c6362b6e48fe3aa0ccba0563abadbdace55349c2460e5f604cf99f520dcf4d43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOS:9:4",
      "sequence": 6042,
      "chapter_label": "JOS 9",
      "verse_label": "4",
      "locator": {
