        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "Joshua made peace with them, and made a covenant with them, to let them live. The princes of the congregation swore to them.",
      "ko": "여호수아가 곧 그들과 화친하여 그들을 살리리라는 언약을 맺고 회중 족장들이 그들에게 맹세하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "81467f15ddc9c4cb84083b6d79c2bfe10195dfabdf54314c73e610dbb8e36325",
      "translation_text_hash": "41b3823e0e40e13bbf0519ca6785a24266c6172b31d7c0458f1941b1d13b6f42",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
