      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "At the end of three days after they had made a covenant with them, they heard that they were their neighbors, and that they lived among them.",
      "ko": "그들과 언약을 맺은 후 삼일이 지나서야 그들은 근린에 있어 자기들 중에 거주하는 자라 함을 들으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c725c9befccd49045cbbcc52bb795dd53ded7c475367339c732dbb5b087c99a9",
      "translation_text_hash": "0ac38251b6b548f6b1af244b2950b30fd2f639c9a52791f8d8b5ebeadff9dc0c",
